  "semantics": [
    "The integer classifier API now returns a four-word C vector container under explicit ARM base PCS. On the qualified M4 target this lowers to R0 tag, R1 native auxiliary word, R2 native limit and R3 original incoming3. No output word is discarded to remove assembly.",
    "Binary32 auxiliary is~(bits<<1)&0xff000000 and limit0xff000000. Binary64 auxiliary is highword<<1 and limit2047. Encoded tags remain zero0/subnormal4/normal5/infinity3/NaN7; both signs and all exponent fields are covered.",
    "All11 selected C consumers use the shared typed declaration and select lane0. Their compiler profiles stay unchanged. Nine edited caller objects remain byte-identical; GCC sinf/tanf change private register saves and pass full-state routine regressions.",
    "Full provider classifier instruction bytes equal the directly stock-tested probe bytes. All other provider function/section bytes remain unchanged; only the binary64 classifier code changes from the prior provider.",
    "An unmodified GoMore helper receives new GCC private table-label identifiers from the shared-header type. Exactly four string-table replacements account for its entire raw object difference. No code/data/relocation/symbol-record bytes are normalized or changed.",
    "No source-plan/cache-layout edits, new writable state, imports, or duplicate strong symbols are added. The provider and header no longer use named-register variables or inline assembly."
  ],
  "limitations": [
    "The provider is qualified with the selected Clang profile; existing callers use their prior Clang/GCC profiles. The C vector type and PCS annotation are compiler extensions. Other compiler/target profiles require ABI requalification.",
    "Primary leaf checks cover all four return registers, all S0-S31 registers, saved R4-R11, full FPSCR, SP and masks. R12 and APSR caller-scratch effects are not promised; whole-program ABI equivalence is not inferred from tag equality alone.",
    "Full caller checks cover S0 return, full FPSCR, public RAM, saved registers, SP and masks;8192 private stack bytes below incoming SP are excluded. Two GCC caller entry frames grow16 bytes; hardware stack budget/timing remain unverified.",
    "FPU-disabled replay covers integer classifier leaves only. Full math regression remains separately primed. Emulator observations do not establish physical boot, lazy-FPU/interrupt timing or concurrent behavior.",
    "Removing the explicit PCS annotation was observationally neutral under the selected probe profile, with identical compiled instruction bodies. It is recorded as neutral, not counted as a rejected defect; the public API retains the explicit contract.",
    "927-unit relocatable composition retains72 application and22 boot imports, including five remaining callback bindings and five parent SpO2 stages. Complete source startup and physical hardware behavior remain open."
  ],
